                                                    <Value EvaluationMode="Auto">Deliberation was made on following Para of Clause No. 2.b and 2.e of Annexure 9 of Integrated Organization Development and Human Resource Management Policy i.e. Guideline on Recruitment through Internal Vacancy, which states</Value>
