                                              <Paragraph>
                                                <TextRuns>
                                                  <TextRun>
                                                    <Value EvaluationMode="Auto">Recruitment and Selection shall be based on head count requirement, reviewed and recommended by HR Staffing Committee duly approved by CEO, based on need and being in line with the Bank’s Long term Strategy."</Value>
