                                            <Paragraphs>
                                              <Paragraph>
                                                <TextRuns>
                                                  <TextRun>
                                                    <Value EvaluationMode="Auto">In the same backdrop, the committee recommended to announce internal vacancy to identify and create a pool of potential candidates that could fill in the positions required to meet the strategic objective of the bank spelled out by the long term vision of the Bank by allocating 15 days to collect the application electronically via izone3. </Value>
                                                    <Style>
                                                      <FontWeight>Normal</FontWeight>
                                                    </Style>
                                                  </TextRun>
                                                </TextRuns>
